    (v_topic_id, 'Water stress', '', 'Tình trạng thiếu nước / áp lực nguồn nước continuously', 'Ancient farmers adjusted their crop combinations to cope with growing conditions under extreme water stress.', 'Test 3', 2, 104, NOW() + interval '3504 seconds'),
